	Toolx  |  Roblox utility toolkit
	Works as a LocalScript or from an executor (Delta etc.)

	Close:     the X button
	Minimize:  the - button (collapses into a pill at the top, tap the pill to restore)
	PC:        the toggle key minimizes / restores (RightShift by default, rebind it in Settings)

	Add features later through the exposed API:
		local tab = Toolx.AddTab("Name")
